# PulseChat Client Environment Variables

# Backend API & Socket server URL when deploying client to Vercel and backend to Render
# Example: https://pulsechat-server.onrender.com
# Note: Leave empty when running locally or serving client statically from the backend
VITE_API_URL=https://your-pulsechat-backend.onrender.com
VITE_SERVER_URL=https://your-pulsechat-backend.onrender.com
